      "zh": "Atari 2600（Video Computer System）",
      "en": "Atari 2600 (Video Computer System)"
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1977,
    "manufacturer": "Atari, Inc.",
    "category": "game-console",
    "description": "1977 年雅达利公司推出的卡带式家用游戏机，以 6507 处理器与 TIA 电视接口适配器实现无帧缓冲的逐行图形，确立了主机与卡带分离的产业模式。",
    "authors": [
      {
        "name": "箱庭电子博物馆项目组",
        "role": "author"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Atari 2600（原名 Video Computer System，简称 VCS）是雅达利公司于 1977 年推出的家用游戏机，是第一台把游戏程序装进可更换 ROM 卡带并做成大众商品的机器。它以 MOS 6507 处理器、TIA 电视接口适配器与 RIOT 6532 三颗芯片为核心，用仅 128 字节的工作内存实现无帧缓冲的逐行图形，确立了主机与卡带分离的产业模式。",
      "en": "The Atari 2600 (originally Video Computer System, VCS) is a home video game console released by Atari, Inc. in 1977, the first machine to popularise game programs on swappable ROM cartridges. Built around the MOS 6507 CPU, the TIA chip and the RIOT 6532, it produced frame-bufferless graphics with only 128 bytes of RAM, establishing the console-and-cartridge business model."
    },
